@page "/"

<PageTitle>Smart-X | Ingestion Gateway</PageTitle>

<section class="section">
    <span class="mono-label accent-text">Telemetry ingestion and control</span>
    <h1>Smart-X Ingestion Gateway</h1>
    <p>
        A typed telemetry pipeline for field sensors, built on .NET 8 and Blazor WebAssembly.
        Validate deployment trees, stream readings and issue manual overrides from one console.
    </p>
    <div class="filter-chips">
        <a href="command-stream" class="accent-button">Enter Command Stream</a>
        <a href="dashboard" class="ghost-button">Open Ingestion</a>
    </div>

    <div class="insights-list" style="max-width: 65ch; margin-top: 3rem;">
        <div class="insight-card">
            <h3>Real-time ingestion</h3>
            <p>Generic readings carry floats, integers and booleans without boxing, and aggregate in place.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="insight-card">
            <h3>Recursive deployment validation</h3>
            <p>Nested device trees are checked from the facility down to every sensor node.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="insight-card">
            <h3>Predictive overrides</h3>
            <p>Repeated searches, commands and critical readings surface as suggested actions.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="panel-header" style="margin-top: 3rem;">
        <span class="mono-label">&copy; 2026 Smart-X Systems</span>
        <span class="mono-label">.NET 8 &middot; Blazor WebAssembly</span>
    </footer>
</section>
